WEBVTT

00:00:00.367 --> 00:00:02.900
Are you a SMART fella,

00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:04.933
or a FART smella?

00:00:04.933 --> 00:00:06.433
Let's find OUT!

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:08.133
Okay,

00:00:08.133 --> 00:00:09.700
a number series!

00:00:09.700 --> 00:00:10.233
Two,

00:00:10.233 --> 00:00:10.767
six,

00:00:10.767 --> 00:00:11.267
eighteen,

00:00:11.267 --> 00:00:11.800
fifty-four,

00:00:11.800 --> 00:00:12.867
and then...

00:00:12.867 --> 00:00:14.433
what comes next?

00:00:14.433 --> 00:00:14.967
A.

00:00:14.967 --> 00:00:16.533
One hundred eight,

00:00:16.533 --> 00:00:17.067
B.

00:00:17.067 --> 00:00:18.633
One hundred sixty-two,

00:00:18.633 --> 00:00:19.167
C.

00:00:19.167 --> 00:00:20.733
One hundred fifty,

00:00:20.733 --> 00:00:21.767
or D.

00:00:21.767 --> 00:00:23.367
Two hundred sixteen?

00:00:23.367 --> 00:00:24.400
Five seconds!

00:00:30.200 --> 00:00:31.400
TIME'S UP!

00:00:32.067 --> 00:00:33.700
The answer is...

00:00:33.700 --> 00:00:34.233
B,

00:00:34.233 --> 00:00:35.867
one hundred sixty-two!

00:00:35.867 --> 00:00:39.100
Each number is multiplied by three:

00:00:39.100 --> 00:00:39.633
two,

00:00:39.633 --> 00:00:40.167
six,

00:00:40.167 --> 00:00:40.733
eighteen,

00:00:40.733 --> 00:00:41.267
fifty-four,

00:00:41.267 --> 00:00:44.500
so fifty-four times three is one

00:00:44.500 --> 00:00:45.600
hundred sixty-two.

00:00:46.733 --> 00:00:47.133
So,

00:00:47.133 --> 00:00:49.167
are you smart or fart?

00:00:49.167 --> 00:00:51.600
Count up your correct answers to

00:00:51.600 --> 00:00:52.800
find your rank!

00:00:53.967 --> 00:00:54.300
So,

00:00:54.300 --> 00:00:55.700
how did you do?

00:00:55.700 --> 00:00:57.067
Comment your score below,

00:00:57.067 --> 00:00:58.433
and follow for more!
